    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Chapter 7 · Session 20</span>\n<h2>Session 20 — Practical excercises</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14486 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Chương 7 · Buổi 20</span>\n<h2>Buổi 20 — Practical excercises</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14486 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Practical excercises<br>Practice appying AI for producing creative products</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ĐN1</strong> — What is meant by a sales promotion trap or spiral? Evaluate the promotional war that has developed in the fast-food industry as various competitors promote their 99 cents or dollar menus. What are the options for companies in deciding to participate in the promotional wars? (L05)</li>\n<li><strong>ĐN2</strong> — Discuss the role of sales promotion as part of the promotional mix and how it can be integrated with other marketing communication tools. (L04)</li>\n<li><strong>ĐN3</strong> — What is meant by a sales promotion trap or spiral? Evaluate the promotional war that has developed in the fast-food industry as various competitors promote their 99 cents or dollar menus. What are the options for companies in deciding to participate in the promotional wars? (L05)</li>\n<li><strong>CT1</strong> — Discuss how digital and social media are influencing the way people watch television. What are some of the ways television advertisers can leverage social media to work to their advantage?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
