    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Chapter 8 · Session 23</span>\n<h2>Session 23 — Chapter 10 (continue): Media Planning and Strategy</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14486 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Chương 8 · Buổi 23</span>\n<h2>Buổi 23 — Chapter 10 (continue): Media Planning and Strategy</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14486 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 10 (continue): Media Planning and Strategy<br>Evaluation and follow up, Characteristics of media</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ĐN1</strong> — The opening vignette to the chapter discusses how many multinational companies want to turn many of their products and services into global brands. Discuss some of the challenges marketers are facing from regional and local brands and how this might impact their efforts to develop strong global brands. (L01, 03)</li>\n<li><strong>ĐN2</strong> — Why are so many multinational companies are expanding into China. What challenges do marketers and advertising agencies face in developing IMC programs for the Chinese market? (L02)</li>\n<li><strong>CT1</strong> — Discuss some recent examples of product placements and/or integrations. Describe the context in which they were used, and how they intended to reach their target markets. Explain where these placements and/or integrations would fit on Hudson’s branded entertainment continuum</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
