    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Assessment 1/7</span>\n<h2>Artificial Intelligence tool using</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14486 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Đầu điểm 1/7</span>\n<h2>Artificial Intelligence tool using</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14486 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">5.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">All the course</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Guided Project</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Students can use AI tools in the group project for brainstorming IMC campaign ideas, developing customer journey maps, generating advertising concepts, headlines, and slogans, and refining writing, proofreading, and presentation design</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Completion of the Coursera Guided Project is compulsory. Upon successful completion, students will earn 10 points</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Student can use AI tools such as Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Copilot, Canva AI, Adobe Firefly</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=MKT304\">Exam Room — MKT304</a> (2 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=MKT304\">Phòng thi — MKT304</a> (2 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
