    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Assessment 4/7</span>\n<h2>Group Project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14486 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Đầu điểm 4/7</span>\n<h2>Group Project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14486 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">35.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: 10 weeksOP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: (An RBL-integrated group project) Students can develop their IMC recommendations based on real-world evidence: using credible secondary sources such as company reports, academic articles, industry reports, marketing databases, or official websites, or collecting primary data: surveys, interviews, observation,etc.OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Maximum length of the group assignment should be 20 pages excluding appendices. OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Based on topics of studied units</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Group presentation in class room</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">This assignment should have 3 components: a formal presentation, a report and a creative product (ad TVC, print ad or media kit) as part of the communication plan.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 55 — Final Project Presentation</li><li>Session 56 — Final Project Presentation</li><li>Session 57 — Final Project Presentation</li><li>Session 58 — Final Project Presentation</li><li>Session 59 — Final Project Presentation</li><li>Session 60 — Final Project Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 55 — Final Project Presentation</li><li>Buổi 56 — Final Project Presentation</li><li>Buổi 57 — Final Project Presentation</li><li>Buổi 58 — Final Project Presentation</li><li>Buổi 59 — Final Project Presentation</li><li>Buổi 60 — Final Project Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=MKT304\">Exam Room — MKT304</a> (2 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=MKT304\">Phòng thi — MKT304</a> (2 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
