    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Further study</span>\n<h2>Links for further study</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Collected automatically from the syllabus, the slides and the material pack. Some may have moved since the university published them.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Học thêm</span>\n<h2>Link học thêm</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Gom tự động từ syllabus, slide và gói tài liệu. Một số link có thể đã đổi chỗ kể từ khi trường công bố.</p></div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/projects/chatgpt-for-beginners-market-research-ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/projects/chatgpt-for-beginners-market-research-ai</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/projects/prompt-engineering-generative-ai-for-marketing-advertising\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/projects/prompt-engineering-generative-ai-for-marketing-advertising</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.interbrand.com/best-brands/best-global-brands/2018/ranking/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.interbrand.com/best-brands/best-global-brands/2018/ranking/</a> <small>— slide Belch 12e PPT Ch01, tài liệu Belch_12e_PPT_Ch01.pptx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hbr.org/2015/09/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://hbr.org/2015/09/</a> <small>— slide Belch 12e PPT Ch05, tài liệu Belch_12e_PPT_Ch05.pptx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/specializations/prompt-engineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/specializations/prompt-engineering</a> <small>— tài liệu MKT304_AI Integration Guide_FA25.docx</small></li>\n</ul>"
