    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Material pack</span>\n<h2>The student material pack</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">22 pptx · 1 docx. Slides are shown in the lessons above; the other files are downloaded inside FLM with your FPT account.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT304 · Gói tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Gói tài liệu sinh viên</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">22 pptx · 1 docx. Slide đã gắn vào các bài phía trên; các tệp khác tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT.</p></div>\n<table><thead><tr><th>File<br><small>Tệp</small></th><th>Type<br><small>Loại</small></th><th>Size<br><small>Dung lượng</small></th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch01/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch01.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>10.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch02/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch02.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>15.6 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch03/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch03.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>4.6 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch04/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch04.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>32.2 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch05/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch05.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>15.0 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch06/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch06.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>21.0 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch07/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch07.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>9.8 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch08/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch08.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>16.1 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch09/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch09.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>30.9 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch10/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch10.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>4.0 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch11/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch11.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>11.6 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch12/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch12.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>24.0 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch13/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch13.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>6.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch14/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch14.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>8.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch15/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch15.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>18.8 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch16/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch16.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>27.8 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch17/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch17.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>15.0 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch18/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch18.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>6.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch19/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch19.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>23.6 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch20/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch20.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>15.7 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch21/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch21.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>13.9 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Belch_12e_PPT_Ch22/Belch_12e_PPT_Ch22.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>3.7 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MKT304_AI Integration Guide_FA25/MKT304_AI Integration Guide_FA25.docx</td><td>docx</td><td>0.0 MB</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>"
